# AI-Assisted Driver Drowsiness Detection System

## Project Overview

The AI-Assisted Driver Drowsiness Detection System is a real-time driver monitoring solution designed to identify signs of fatigue, drowsiness, and inattention using Computer Vision and Artificial Intelligence. The system continuously analyzes a driver's facial features through a webcam feed and generates alerts when symptoms of fatigue are detected.

The primary objective of this project is to improve road safety by providing early warnings before a driver's condition becomes dangerous.

---

## Problem Statement

Driver fatigue is one of the leading causes of road accidents worldwide. Long driving hours, lack of sleep, and reduced attention can significantly increase the risk of collisions.

Traditional monitoring methods often fail to detect fatigue in real time. This project addresses that challenge by automatically analyzing facial behavior and generating alerts whenever signs of drowsiness are detected.

