## Alert System

The system implements a multi-level warning mechanism.

### Level 1: Visual Alert

The dashboard displays warning indicators when fatigue symptoms begin to appear.

---

### Level 2: Audio Alert

The browser generates an audible warning to capture the driver's attention.

---

### Level 3: Voice Warning

Text-to-speech functionality can provide spoken safety reminders when fatigue becomes critical.

