## Backend Functionality

The FastAPI backend performs the following tasks:

* Processes webcam data
* Runs facial landmark detection
* Calculates fatigue metrics
* Generates risk scores
* Provides API endpoints for the frontend dashboard

Example endpoints:

```text
/video-feed
/metrics
```

These endpoints allow the React frontend to receive live updates.

---

## Frontend Functionality

The React frontend is responsible for:

* Displaying the dashboard
* Showing live metrics
* Visualizing fatigue levels
* Presenting alerts and warnings
* Updating information in real time

The dashboard continuously requests updated data from the FastAPI backend.

